        "execSummary":  "The enterprise AI talent gap is now a recognized constraint on ROI, and Anthropic is directly addressing it by building a credentialed engineering workforce trained to deploy Claude inside large organizations — a move that simultaneously accelerates adoption and creates a talent moat around its ecosystem. For enterprise and customer-support leaders, this is a signal to evaluate whether their own AI implementation teams have the depth to unlock full platform value, or whether a program like this could fast-track capability. The residency model mirrors how elite professional training works in medicine and law, suggesting Anthropic is positioning AI deployment as a skilled discipline rather than a commodity skill. Organizations not investing in structured AI talent development risk falling behind peers who do.",
