        "summary":  "Google expanded Gemini\u0027s integration ecosystem with a new wave of connected apps across three categories: productivity tools (Airtable, Linear), creative platforms (Adobe, Webflow), and lifestyle services (Peloton, SeatGeek), accessible via Gemini settings or @ mentions within chat. The rollout began September 23, 2026, and positions Gemini as a unified workspace hub that reduces context-switching across fragmented enterprise tool stacks. Users can activate integrations conversationally, enabling AI-mediated orchestration across multiple applications from a single interface.",
